      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 113,
      "s": 53,
      "start": 394.02,
      "end": 396.6,
      "text": "我们下载好小米米IOTAuto后",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 114,
      "s": 53,
      "start": 396.6,
      "end": 398.5,
      "text": "就可以绑定账号了。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 115,
      "s": 54,
      "start": 398.68,
      "end": 405.52,
      "text": "打开配置、设备与服务、添加集成，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 116,
      "s": 54,
      "start": 406.54,
      "end": 408.78,
      "text": "搜索小米米IOTAuto，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 117,
      "s": 55,
      "start": 409.36,
      "end": 412.08,
      "text": "选择后会跳出登录小米账号的界面。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 118,
      "s": 56,
      "start": 415.18,
      "end": 416.71,
      "text": "在这里，我们输入",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 119,
      "s": 56,
      "start": 416.71,
      "end": 420.41,
      "text": "登录米家的账号和密码，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 120,
      "s": 56,
      "start": 428.31,
      "end": 429.39,
      "text": "之后就会自动识别",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 121,
      "s": 56,
      "start": 429.39,
      "end": 431.58,
      "text": "米家账号已经配对的设备。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 122,
      "s": 57,
      "start": 438.39,
      "end": 439.39,
      "text": "现在我们可以看到，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 123,
      "s": 57,
      "start": 439.39,
      "end": 441.01,
      "text": "这些设备已经绑定在了",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 124,
      "s": 57,
      "start": 441.01,
      "end": 442.37,
      "text": "HomeAssistant系统上了。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 125,
      "s": 58,
      "start": 442.71,
      "end": 444.29,
      "text": "我们在这个页面上",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 126,
      "s": 58,
      "start": 444.29,
      "end": 447.01,
      "text": "可以控制设备或者读取设备的参数。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 127,
      "s": 59,
      "start": 447.55,
      "end": 448.95,
      "text": "那么，如何通过MQTT",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 128,
      "s": 59,
      "start": 448.95,
      "end": 450.56,
      "text": "来控制这些设备呢？",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 129,
      "s": 60,
      "start": 452.29,
      "end": 453.83,
      "text": "点击左下角配置",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 130,
      "s": 60,
      "start": 453.83,
      "end": 458.01,
      "text": "自动化与场景创建自动化。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 131,
      "s": 61,
      "start": 461.12,
      "end": 464.57,
      "text": "这里有两个配置，第一个是触发器，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 132,
      "s": 61,
      "start": 464.57,
      "end": 466.91,
      "text": "配置触发动作的事件，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 133,
      "s": 61,
      "start": 466.91,
      "end": 469.9,
      "text": "比如说某个设备的参数达到预定值。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 134,
      "s": 62,
      "start": 469.99,
      "end": 472.29,
      "text": "到达某个预定的时间，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 135,
      "s": 62,
      "start": 472.29,
      "end": 474.24,
      "text": "或者收到MQTT消息。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 136,
      "s": 63,
      "start": 475.03,
      "end": 477.99,
      "text": "第二个是事件触发后做出的动作，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 137,
      "s": 63,
      "start": 477.99,
      "end": 480.47,
      "text": "比如说打开或者关闭台灯，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 138,
      "s": 63,
      "start": 480.47,
      "end": 482.46,
      "text": "把灯调暗或者调亮。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 139,
      "s": 64,
      "start": 483.31,
      "end": 486.63,
      "text": "我们在触发器选择收到MQTT时，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 140,
      "s": 64,
      "start": 491.97,
      "end": 494.47,
      "text": "这里MQTT的Topic和Payload",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 141,
      "s": 64,
      "start": 494.47,
      "end": 495.89,
      "text": "都可以随便自定义。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 142,
      "s": 65,
      "start": 496.06,
      "end": 499.29,
      "text": "不过，如果打算绑定很多设备的话，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 143,
      "s": 65,
      "start": 499.29,
      "end": 502.03,
      "text": "最好把归类做好，方便后续管理。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 144,
      "s": 66,
      "start": 504.43,
      "end": 505.27,
      "text": "在动作这里，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 145,
      "s": 66,
      "start": 505.27,
      "end": 508.3,
      "text": "我们可以指定一个或者多个设备，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 146,
      "s": 66,
      "start": 508.31,
      "end": 510.76,
      "text": "比如这里我指定一个小米床头灯，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 147,
      "s": 67,
      "start": 513.77,
      "end": 515.43,
      "text": "配置成触发后开灯，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 148,
      "s": 67,
      "start": 515.51,
      "end": 516.88,
      "text": "亮度调成百分之五十，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 149,
      "s": 67,
      "start": 520.15,
      "end": 521.57,
      "text": "保存后就能生效了。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 150,
      "s": 68,
      "start": 533.35,
      "end": 535.79,
      "text": "为了验证是否生效，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 151,
      "s": 68,
      "start": 535.79,
      "end": 538.13,
      "text": "我们可以用MQTT测试工具，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 152,
      "s": 68,
      "start": 538.13,
      "end": 540.69,
      "text": "比如说MQTTX进行测试。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 153,
      "s": 69,
      "start": 541.33,
      "end": 544.03,
      "text": "这里我们创建一个新的连接，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 154,
      "s": 69,
      "start": 544.03,
      "end": 546.01,
      "text": "Host选择MQTTHomeAssistantLocal。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 155,
      "s": 70,
      "start": 547.12,
      "end": 550.96,
      "text": "端口选择1883username和password",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 156,
      "s": 70,
      "start": 550.96,
      "end": 553.24,
      "text": "就是刚才初始化界面创建的",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 157,
      "s": 70,
      "start": 553.24,
      "end": 556.24,
      "text": "登录账号和密码",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 158,
      "s": 71,
      "start": 556.42,
      "end": 558.74,
      "text": "然后点击连接",
      "speaker": "B",
      "u": 70,
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 159,
      "s": 71,
      "start": 558.74,
      "end": 560.62,
      "text": "成功后可以发一个消息",
      "speaker": "B",
      "u": 70,
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 160,
      "s": 71,
      "start": 560.62,
      "end": 561.78,
      "text": "验证是否可以",
      "speaker": "B",
      "u": 70,
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 161,
      "s": 71,
      "start": 561.78,
      "end": 564.06,
      "text": "通过MQTT控制设备",
      "speaker": "B",
      "u": 70,
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 162,
      "s": 71,
      "start": 564.06,
      "end": 569.32,
      "text": "接下来可以使用ESP32",
      "speaker": "B",
      "u": 70,
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 163,
      "s": 72,
      "start": 569.32,
      "end": 572.06,
      "text": "向HomeAssistant发送MQTT消息",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 164,
      "s": 72,
      "start": 572.06,
      "end": 574.9,
      "text": "注意要保证ESP32和HomeAssistant",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 165,
      "s": 73,
      "start": 574.9,
      "end": 576.52,
      "text": "处于同一局域网下",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 166,
      "s": 73,
      "start": 576.74,
      "end": 578.85,
      "text": "这部分其实非常简单，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 167,
      "s": 73,
      "start": 579.01,
      "end": 580.48,
      "text": "只需要照着IDF的",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 168,
      "s": 73,
      "start": 580.48,
      "end": 583.01,
      "text": "MQTT基础例程做一些配置，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 169,
      "s": 74,
      "start": 583.8,
      "end": 585.75,
      "text": "直接把这个工程缝纫过来。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 170,
      "s": 75,
      "start": 591.9,
      "end": 594.34,
      "text": "在这个MQTTConfig结构体",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 171,
      "s": 75,
      "start": 594.34,
      "end": 596.04,
      "text": "配置URI，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 172,
      "s": 76,
      "start": 596.38,
      "end": 599.16,
      "text": "配置HomeAssistant的用户名和密码。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 173,
      "s": 77,
      "start": 603.02,
      "end": 604.85,
      "text": "然后调用这个API",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 174,
      "s": 77,
      "start": 604.85,
      "end": 607.09,
      "text": "发布MQTT消息，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 175,
      "s": 77,
      "start": 607.09,
      "end": 608.49,
      "text": "API的具体用法",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 176,
      "s": 77,
      "start": 608.49,
      "end": 610.93,
      "text": "可以参考IDF编程指南。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 177,
      "s": 78,
      "start": 612.47,
      "end": 614.01,
      "text": "MQTT消息要确认",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 178,
      "s": 78,
      "start": 614.01,
      "end": 616.86,
      "text": "和HomeAssistant中的配置保持一致。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 179,
      "s": 79,
      "start": 617.85,
      "end": 619.25,
      "text": "调用之前确认一下",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 180,
      "s": 79,
      "start": 619.25,
      "end": 621.77,
      "text": "MQTT是否处于连接状态。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 181,
      "s": 80,
      "start": 622.09,
      "end": 624.07,
      "text": "当你需要控制设备时，",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 182,
      "s": 80,
      "start": 624.07,
      "end": 626.25,
      "text": "就可以调用对应的自定义函数。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 183,
      "s": 81,
      "start": 627.7,
      "end": 631.24,
      "text": "打开台灯。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "role": "narrator"
    },
    {
      "i": 184,
      "s": 82,
      "start": 634.06,
      "end": 636.7,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友快来体验一下吧！",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 185,
      "s": 83,
      "start": 636.7,
      "end": 637.9,
      "text": "大家对HomeAssistant",
      "speaker": "B",
      "role": "storyteller"
    },
    {
      "i": 186,
      "s": 83,
      "start": 637.9,
